"required. See the `Nutanix Compatibility and Interoperability table "
"<https://portal.nutanix.com/page/documents/compatibility-"
"interoperability-"
"matrix/software?partnerName=Morpheus%20Data&solutionType=all&componentVersion=all&hypervisor=all&validationType=all>`_"
" for additional information"
msgstr "Pour la version |morpheus| 6.3.4 et supérieure, la version Nutanix AOS 6.5.3.7+ est requise. Consultez le `tableau de compatibilité et d'interopérabilité Nutanix <https://portal.nutanix.com/page/documents/compatibility-interoperability-matrix/software?partnerName=Morpheus%20Data&solutionType=all&componentVersion=all&hypervisor=all&validationType=all>`_ pour plus d'informations"

